{"version":1,"key":"quest:183","content":{"id":183,"title":"什么是 scroll-behavior？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:183","type":"quest","id":183},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"用 CSS scroll-behavior 实现平滑滚动","meta":"","excerpt":"当用户点击页面内的锚点链接或「返回顶部」按钮时，浏览器默认会瞬间跳转到目标位置，体验上比较生硬。CSS 提供了 scroll-behavior 属性来解决这个问题，只需要一行声明就能让页面滚动变得平滑。 它的取值很简单： auto：浏览器的默认行为，瞬间滚动完成smooth：平滑滚动 最常见的用法是直接设置在 html","target":{"key":"card:750","type":"card","id":750},"citeKey":"card:750"}],"trail":[{"time":1780218536862,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1780375731433,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1780376578380,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1780218536862,"updateTime":1780218536862,"resolvedTime":1780376578380},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1780218536862}}